l him dayooo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3292.95, "timestamp": "00:54:52", "text": "不。哦，好的。好的。好的。以便"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3293.95, "timestamp": "00:54:53", "text": "那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3297.75, "timestamp": "00:54:57", "text": "呃，这种刻板印象甚至包括鞠躬。"}]